OL,3,GNEWSACall for more powers to tackle
OL,4,Aillegal bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA North East MP has called for the
OL,7,Fpolice to be given greater powers to
OL,8,Ftackle the ''scourge of balaclava-clad
OL,9,Fcriminals'' using illegal off-road
OL,10,Fbikes.
OL,12,FSpeaking in a Westminster debate
OL,13,FDarlington's Labour MP, Lola McEvoy,
OL,14,Fsaid the riders were showing ''a
OL,15,Fblatant disregard for the law, drug
OL,16,Fdealing in the street and carrying
OL,17,Fknives and weapons".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
