OL,3,GNEWSACall for more powers to tackle
OL,4,Aillegal bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the region's police forces
OL,7,Fwere playing a game of ''cat and mouse
OL,8,Fwith the criminals" and needed to be
OL,9,Fgiven greater funding to tackle the
OL,10,Fproblem.
OL,12,F''We need more powers and more action
OL,13,Fto make a difference," McEvoy said.
